	</p>

	<h2>2. What eCamx is — and is not</h2>
	<p>
		eCamx is a directory. We index publicly available live streams from
		third-party webcam platforms and present them in one place. We do not
		operate those platforms, employ or represent any performer, produce any
		content, or host any video.
	</p>
	<p>
		Every stream you watch here is delivered by the originating platform through
		its own embedded player. Your relationship for that stream — payments,
		tipping, private shows, account terms, disputes — is with that platform,
		not with us.
	</p>

	<h2>3. No account, no payment</h2>
	<p>
		eCamx is free to browse and has no registration. We never ask for payment
		card details and never process payments. If any page claiming to be eCamx
		asks you for a card number, it is not us — please report it.
	</p>

	<h2>4. Affiliate relationship</h2>
	<p>
		We earn commission when visitors sign up or spend money on the platforms we
